ruth test confirmed genuinely worktree-only + non-vacuous; no import cycle; W2-ready (returns materials, never touches a target worktree). Reviewer A flagged one real latent CONCERN: `_trigger_background_source_summary` was NOT gated (could spawn live claude in a future stubbed path) + mutated global `os.environ[\"ANCHOR_RUNNER_CMD\"]` from a daemon thread.\n15\t- **FIX (judge-required hardening).** Gated the background summary on `ANCHOR_PROACTIVE_SUMMARY` (read directly â€” no anchor_gui import; OFF in tests/healthcheck â†’ hard no-op, never spawns live claude; persist+prompt unchanged). Removed the daemon-thread env mutation (relies on ambient process env; only runs in production). +2 tests (no-summarize-when-gated, no-env-mutation). 12 keystone tests.\n16\t- **GATE 2 (orchestrator-run, of record).** `python -m pytest -q` â†’ **GREEN 1214 passed, 1 skipped**.\n17\t- **VERDICT: GO.** Commit scoped (terminal_session.py, handoff.py, tests/test_stage_handoff_keystone_v11.py).\n18\t\n19\t## Wave 2 â€” Wire researchâ†’plan advance through the keystone (THE user fix, UI) â€” âœ… GREEN (awaiting John's UI sign-off)\n20\t\n21\t- **EXECUTE.** `/api/rnd/advance_session` (researchâ†’plan) rewired through W1's keystone: `prepare_stage_handoff(pid, source, 'planning')` (persists the live research docs + builds the REAL doc-referencing prompt) â†’ `start_session(paste_prompt=prompt, parent_session_id=source)` â†’ `write_handoff_md(plan_wt, doc_rels, skill, summary)` + `write_next_prompt` â†’ `record_stage_link`. Mockup `_mockups/research_to_plan_handoff.html`. New `tests/test_advance_research_to_plan_live_v11.py` (worktree-only backend) + `tests/test_advance_research_to_plan_ui_v11.py` (Playwright, discriminating real-doc-path token).\n22\t- **GATE 1.** GREEN 1218.\n23\t- **REVIEW (2 independent, refute).** Both **GO**. Reviewer A: UI test is genuinely worktree-only-live (NOT a mask), the `research/run-1/REPORT.md` token is non-vacuous (reaches the prompt only via the W1 persis